# {{lb|en|figuratively}} Anything that [[cover]]s or [[conceal]]s something else; a [[cloak]]. {{defdate|from 9th c.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|author=w:William Shakespeare|title=[[w:Hamlet|The Tragedy of Hamlet, Prince of Denmark]]|title2=Hamlet|year=c. 1599-1602|location2=New York|publisher2=Dover Publications, Inc.|year2=1992|isbn2=0-486-27278-8|section=act 1, scene 1|page2=6|text=But look, the morn, in russet '''mantle''' clad, walks o'er the dew of yon high eastward hill.}}
